# Legacy URL support for the hosts that read a `_redirects` file from the
# publish directory (Netlify, Cloudflare Pages). GitHub Pages ignores this file
# and answers the old path with the app shell instead.
#
# The contact page used to be a static document at /contact.html. It is now the
# Angular route /contact, so old links, bookmarks and search results should land
# on the form rather than on the app shell's fallback page.
/contact.html /contact 301
